# AMD "pro" GPU stack — appended ONLY for --gpu-driver amd-pro. AMD has NO
# proprietary Xorg driver: the OPEN amdgpu kernel driver (VIDEO_CARDS=amdgpu
# radeonsi) IS the display driver. These add AMD's proprietary closed userspace:
# the AMDGPU-PRO Vulkan ICD, the OpenCL runtime, and the AMF media encoder.
# AMD-GPU-PRO-EULA accepted via package.license/amd-pro.
media-libs/amdgpu-pro-vulkan
dev-libs/amdgpu-pro-opencl
media-video/amdgpu-pro-amf
